  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: Ignore OpenAPI errors by default. 2025-06-05\n- feat(Source Generators): Added parallel client generation. 2025-06-05\n- feat: Now Enum converter will handle JsonTokenType.Null 2025-05-13\n- feat: Add support for visual studio 2025-05-09\n- feat: Added AnyOfLikeStructure ToString() override. 2025-03-30\n- feat: Added AddMissingPathParameters setting that true by default. 2025-03-30\n- feat: Updated System.Text.Json to 9.0.3 2025-03-21\n- feat(cli): initial version of generation .http files from openapi 2025-03-06\n- feat: ApiExceptions now will show json instead ReasonPhrase for all possible cases. 2025-02-28\n- feat: Now need to mark all SourceGenerator AdditionalFiles with AutoSDK_OpenApiSpecification = true explicitly. 2025-02-26\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: Fixed missed serialization of complex query parameters. 2025-06-17\n- fix: Add AutoSDK_Namespace and ClassName metadata 2025-06-05\n- fix: Fixed deepinfra.json issues 2025-05-16\n- fix: Fixed generation if there is file type with binary format. 2025-05-12\n- fix: Fixed issue with invalid default value for big AnyOfs. 2025-05-08\n- fix: Fixed rare issue with conflict types inside AnyOf constructors 2025-05-08\n- fix: Update OpenAPI spec 2025-05-08\n- fix: Add missing analyzer dependencies 2025-05-08\n- fix: Add missing dependencies for analyzers 2025-05-08\n- fix: Revert 3 2025-05-07",
